# SHARED BigCommerce store — used by BOTH Safety Sector (SS) and SectorCare (SC).
# TEMPLATE ONLY (no real values here).
#
# Business setup (verified from approved sends): SS and SC are two storefronts on
# ONE BigCommerce store, hash 498h0egvgn:
#     store 498h0egvgn
#       ├─ safetysector.com.au  → SS  → SS Klaviyo (isolated)
#       └─ sectorcare.com.au    → SC  → SC Klaviyo (isolated)
#
# Copy this file to  Brands/_shared/.env  (git-ignored, NEVER committed) and paste
# ONE read-only BigCommerce token for store 498h0egvgn. Both SS.config.json and
# SC.config.json reference this single file (bigcommerce.envPath) — the credential
# is NOT duplicated per brand. Read-only "Products: read-only" scope is sufficient;
# all access is GET-only.
#
# This file holds NO Klaviyo key. Klaviyo stays strictly per brand:
#   SS key → Brands/SS/.env (SS_KLAVIYO_API_KEY)
#   SC key → Brands/SC/.env (SC_KLAVIYO_API_KEY)
#
# The store hash is parsed from API PATH automatically.
# API PATH: https://api.bigcommerce.com/stores/498h0egvgn/v3/
